#! console --size 140x34
# The session sidebar: a New session chip that asks which project, Search that filters in place, and
# the wheel sliding the rows.
wait-frame 15000 command palette
key alt-n
wait-frame 10000 untitled
key alt-b
wait-frame 5000 Search
snap sidebar
mouse down 8 1
mouse up 8 1
type unt
wait-frame 5000 ⌕ unt
snap searching
key esc
quit
